  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3077 specifies the framework, functions, and procedures for information-centric networking (ICN) device registration and discovery in distributed directory system functions collocated in gateways of each application domain and interworking of the directory system functions of various application domains by extending the ICN approach. It also specifies the communication procedure for interworking of devices within and across heterogeneous application domains for device management as well as accessing data and services provided by the devices.</abstract>
